{"id":377,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"男女別学で主体性を育てる桐光学園","feature_description":"桐光学園中学校・高等学校は、男女別学と中高6年間の教育プロジェクトを軸に、自ら考え判断し行動できる力を育てる学校です。学習指導とクラブ活動が両立し、全国大会出場の実績を持つ部も多く、放課後まで充実した学校生活を送れます。探究や進路指導も含め、将来につながる学びが整っています。実績と挑戦を両輪に成長できます。学びの幅も広がります。","clubs":[{"id":6904,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.toko.ed.jp/high/campuslife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6905,"name":"軟式野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.toko.ed.jp/high/campuslife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6906,"name":"バスケットボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.toko.ed.jp/high/campuslife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6907,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.toko.ed.jp/high/campuslife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6908,"name":"ラグビー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.toko.ed.jp/high/campuslife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6909,"name":"硬式テニス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.toko.ed.jp/high/campuslife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6910,"name":"卓球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.toko.ed.jp/high/campuslife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6911,"name":"ハンドボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.toko.ed.jp/high/campuslife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6912,"name":"バドミントン部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.toko.ed.jp/high/campuslife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6913,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.toko.ed.jp/high/campuslife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6914,"name":"水泳部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.toko.ed.jp/high/campuslife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6915,"name":"ダンス部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://www.toko.ed.jp/high/campuslife/club.html","verified_at":"2026-08-07"},{"id":6916,"name":"武道部(剣道)","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://